Reset the g12a hdmi codec glue on probe. This ensure a sane startup state.

Signed-off-by: Jerome Brunet <jbrunet@baylibre.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20200221121146.1498427-1-jbrunet@baylibre.com
